      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a risk assessment for a warehouse in Rotterdam. Can you give me a breakdown of the primary risk factors we need to consider when storing flammable industrial solvents in high-density racking systems? Specifically looking for things like thermal runaway risks and ventilation issues.",
